COMMENT     The assembly wsSclBrat1.1 is based on 26x PacBio data and Arima2
            Hi-C data generated by the Aquatic Symbiosis Genomics Project
            (https://www.aquaticsymbiosisgenomics.org/). The assembly process
            included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly
            generation with Hifiasm, retained haplotig separation with
            purge_dups, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial
            genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, the primary assembly
            was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale
            scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of
            size. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome
            1 (60,200 - 65,400 Kbp) are unknown.The exact order and orientation
            of the contigs on chromosome 2 (6,260 - 14,100 Kbp) are unknown.The
            exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 4 (48,230
            - 56,200 Kbp) are unknown.The exact order and orientation of the
            contigs on chromosome 5 (8,000 - 9,500 Kbp) are unknown.The exact
            order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 6 (10,500 -
            14,800 Kbp) are unknown.The exact order and orientation of the
            contigs on chromosome 7 (16,850 - 23,700 Kbp) are unknown.The exact
            order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 8 (42,970 -
            45,300 Kbp) are unknown.The exact order and orientation of the
            contigs on chromosome 9 (35,900 - 37,900 Kbp) are unknown.The exact
            order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 10 (21,300 -
            27,200 Kbp) are unknown.
